# Edge Case Safeguards & Security Hardening Plan

This document details the proposed changes to harden the Badminton Court Operations application, fix security vulnerabilities (XSS, client-side routing bypass, guest privilege escalation), and implement robust input boundaries.

## User Review Required
Please review the proposed architectural and UI security changes:
1. **Redirect Guests from Settings:** Anonymous guest accounts will be immediately redirected to `dashboard.html` if they try to access `settings.html` directly.
2. **Hide/Disable Admin Controls for Guests:** Anonymous guest accounts are in read-only mode for operational settings. They will not see the "Mark Paid" buttons, trainee enrollment inputs, or pricing update options.
3. **Clean Up Old Files:** We propose deleting the unused monolithic files `app.js` and `style.css` in the project root to clean up the codebase.

## Open Questions
- None. All requirements align with the badminton operations workflow and standard frontend security guidelines.

